        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Contingent Glyph"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(abjuration, occult)\n\nA hieracosphinx has an innate magical defense similar to a contingency. When they take a specific type of energy damage (varying by the individual sphinx), they can use their reaction to have the glyph cast haste on them. The glyph is then dormant for 1 week. A critical success to Recall Knowledge about a particular hieracosphinx (30 or higher on the check) reveals which damage type triggers the glyph."
            },
